t":"2025-07-18T10:46:23Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T14:10:00Z","closed_at":"2025-07-30T14:09:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (6 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the auto_translate_mode of a node is set to AutoTranslateMode.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT, it is always generated by POT generation, regardless of the parent node.\nIf internationalization/rendering/root_node_auto_translate in the project settings is set to false and the root node is INHERIT, it will also be generated.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a scene for the Control node.\nSet the Control node's auto_translate_mode to AutoTranslateMode.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_DISABLED.\nAdd a Label node to the child nodes.\nSet the text of the Label node to “Test”.\nSet the Label node's auto_translate_mode to AutoTranslateMode.AUTO_TRANSLATE_MODE_INHERIT.\nAdd the created scene to the POT generation.\nGenerate the POT.\nThe POT contains “Test”.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[pot_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21326746/pot_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c